varamon is an independent, receive-only implementation.

Sources of the waveform description:
- measurements of publicly available recordings;
- the published source of xara (https://github.com/x0rro/xara), MIT licence, copyright (c) 2026 x0rro, which was read as
  documentation of the signal format.

Included from xara, under its MIT licence:
- rust/varamon-core/src/textcomp.dict, the phrase and code table of the modem's text compression. The Rust code that reads
  it (textcomp.rs) follows xara's coder closely.

